could not fully type-check
--
std::is_invocable / invoke_result over a _Bind object evaluated BEFORE any
direct call of it.  The result_of partial specialization used to pick up a
stale same-named _ArgTypes pack ([temp.deduct]/5 -- only the template being
deduced binds its own parameter) and the primary result_of (no ::type) was
cached as the instance, so the traits were false even though a direct call
worked; order-dependent, hence the trait-first layout.
